{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB戀綜《女神配對計劃2》已經播得如火如荼，一眾女神開始與各「求愛勇者」深入互動，而郭珮文面對從美國專程返港追愛的前度俞鋆瑞（Ice），兩人的復合發展引起網民高度關注與兩極熱議。今日（22日）一集，郭珮文獲得Ice的貼心安排，在主題樂園中玩耍，他先安排與郭珮文一起餵狐獴，之後在餐廳中「撐枱腳」。</p><figure><img alt=\"郭珮文獲得Ice的貼心安排，在主題樂園中玩耍。(節目截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261122/1201303710681141248406573.jpeg/H28XQ-_oe7LzCVKOMUSfTZhj9psS1V_kGm1mShptZko\"/><figcaption>郭珮文獲得Ice的貼心安排，在主題樂園中玩耍。(節目截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Ice先安排與郭珮文一起餵狐獴。(節目截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261122/1201303708269285376518204.jpeg/s0EkUtryEn5oxt7JVtLyeagWU3dX9siD444VK-OOFSs\"/><figcaption>Ice先安排與郭珮文一起餵狐獴。(節目截圖)</figcaption></figure><p>郭珮文白背心迫爆上圍 「最強Body」再現成焦點</p><p>雖然郭珮文及Ice的行程很甜蜜，不過大家的焦點還是在郭珮文身上。她當日以一白色小背心現身，「迫爆」的上圍再配上纖腰，身材姣好的她把完美曲線盡現，讓網民不禁驚呼「最強body」再現。</p><figure><img alt=\"郭珮文白背心迫爆上圍。(節目截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261122/1201304512166891520327561.jpeg/zSrXZtd0S5R_7FCRIfLQL60QMr0IxEVxHkjZFB5I2RQ\"/><figcaption>郭珮文白背心迫爆上圍。(節目截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"郭珮文「最強Body」再現成焦點。(節目截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261122/1201304509830533120817092.jpeg/84voyYCdlRBef6c0OHz-2z7ZLF23nBIlgmVTuYJlU7k\"/><figcaption>郭珮文「最強Body」再現成焦點。(節目截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"郭珮文「迫爆」的上圍再配上纖腰，身材姣好的她把完美曲線盡現。(節目截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261122/1201304507108298752056827.jpeg/rIwwK3GCoFrRGwwaZLG7EyAQTZIntHISgw0Sf4MNEn8\"/><figcaption>郭珮文「迫爆」的上圍再配上纖腰，身材姣好的她把完美曲線盡現。(節目截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"郭珮文「最強body」呢個名真係冇得頂。(節目截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261122/1201304504830660608317460.jpeg/2E9ixLpVioVm3GNGB88rBCG5PC2qVeE5Qv1c4UL9XOE\"/><figcaption>郭珮文「最強body」呢個名真係冇得頂。(節目截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"郭珮文以前已經係「最強body」。(節目截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261122/1201304502339112960903845.jpeg/9Kx1jpk5bcvuyKhNnzE2c8RFdvgfuH_ZVlpWMlZaVjI\"/><figcaption>郭珮文以前已經係「最強body」。(節目截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"郭珮文同ICE其實都幾襯。(ig@julianakpm)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261122/1201322994434445312720164.jpeg/TnHhgzbuEJcHjm6W2eG0n0qQswMWTfqJsryXQLK8l0A\"/><figcaption>郭珮文同ICE其實都幾襯。(ig@julianakpm)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"郭珮文扮可愛。(ig@julianakpm)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261122/1201322992379105280285197.jpeg/3GgqBrdySalB0d65qw4LyACVJePeZAADbX6TuG1-k7g\"/><figcaption>郭珮文扮可愛。(ig@julianakpm)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"ICE為郭珮文安排行程。(ig@julianakpm)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261122/1201322990160187392068734.jpeg/TtKWBKa7lheO-rnvDCpMbx0e7zp_m9xY4H9CnOB_Qpw\"/><figcaption>ICE為郭珮文安排行程。(ig@julianakpm)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"郭珮文。(ig@julianakpm)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261122/1201322988041932800625078.jpeg/5ad0jov6MWCyu3nUJFe-ypbJC-iqUSt9FKxdxhSsXcY\"/><figcaption>郭珮文。(ig@julianakpm)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T16:15:27.404778+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":548,"images":11,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T14:56:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T22:17:46.872296+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T16:08:45.867639+00:00","content_hash":"f23d3ce1e9800dca42dec2cbe0688279a66be5fc51c1b0ef3d3a630993dd1e54","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}